h (Condition)\">Command: Approach</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Has to move toward the spellcaster using the shortest route possible.</li>\n<li>Cannot take <a href=\"/wiki/Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Action\">Actions</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Bonus_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Action\">Bonus Actions</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reactions</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Command:_Halt\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Command:_Halt_(Condition)\" title=\"Command: Halt (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Command_Halt_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Command_Halt_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Command_Halt_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Command_Halt_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Command_Halt_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Command_Halt_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Command: Halt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Command_Halt_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Command_Halt_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/Command_Halt_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Command: Halt</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Cannot move.</li>\n<li>Cannot take <a href=\"/wiki/Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Action\">Actions</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Bonus_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Action\">Bonus Actions</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reactions</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202907\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: